Design a module that counts the number of '1' bits in an 8-bit input. The module takes an 8-bit binary number as input and outputs a 3-bit result representing the count of '1's. It uses a dedicated function to perform the bit counting, which is triggered whenever the input changes, ensuring real-time computation of the output.
module top_module(
