Design a 2-to-4 decoder with an enable input. The module generates four output lines (d0, d1, d2, d3) based on the two input select lines (a0, a1), but only when the enable signal (en) is active. Each output corresponds to the binary value determined by the combination of a0 and a1, allowing for unique activation of one of the four outputs while all others remain LOW when enabled.
